texts.k00029:
Evaṃ jhāyī kho, saddha, bhadro purisājānīyo neva pathaviṃ nissāya
jhāyati…pe… yampidaṃ diṭṭhaṃ sutaṃ mutaṃ viññātaṃ pattaṃ pariyesitaṃ anuvicaritaṃ manasā,
tampi nissāya na jhāyati; jhāyati ca pana. Evaṃ jhāyiñca pana, saddha, bhadraṃ purisājānīyaṃ saindā
devā sabrahmakā sapajāpatikā ārakāva namassanti –
‘‘Namo te purisājañña, namo te purisuttama;
Yassa te nābhijānāma, yampi nissāya jhāyasī’’ti. navamaṃ;

texts.k00032:
‘‘Khattiyo seṭṭho janetasmiṃ, ye gottapaṭisārino;
Vijjācaraṇasampanno, so seṭṭho devamānuse’’ti. dasamaṃ;
Nissayavaggo [nissāyavaggo (syā. kaṃ.)] paṭhamo.
Tassuddānaṃ –
Kimatthiyā cetanā tayo, upanisā byasanena ca;
Dve saññā manasikāro, saddho moranivāpakanti.
